  "body": "If single-level living, brick and tile construction and outstanding school zones are high on your wish list, make sure you come and see this property.\r\n\r\nForget trying to assess this opportunity from numbers online. This is a home that deserves to be viewed, experienced and considered on what it actually offers - and the property is here to be sold.\r\n\r\nPositioned well back from the road, this renovated single-level home combines privacy, easy-care living and an incredibly convenient Bucklands Beach location.\r\n\r\nFreshly updated and ready to enjoy, the layout is practical and comfortable, with internal-access garaging adding everyday convenience. Whether you're a young family wanting to secure the school zones, a professional couple looking for low-maintenance living, or downsizers wanting to stay in the area, this is an opportunity you should have on your viewing list.\r\n\r\nAnd the location is a genuine standout.\r\n\r\nPositioned within the highly sought-after golden triangle of schooling, some of East Auckland's most popular schools are remarkably close. Bucklands Beach Intermediate is directly across the road, Pigeon Mountain Primary is right alongside, and Macleans College is an easy five-minute walk away.\r\n\r\nFor families, that level of schooling convenience is incredibly hard to beat.\r\n\r\nPublic transport is also close by, while the beaches, coastal walkways, local amenities and lifestyle attractions that make this part of East Auckland so desirable are all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nRenovated. Single level. Brick and tile. Internal-access garaging. Exceptional schooling. Set back from the road.\r\n\r\nDon't make a decision about this property without seeing it first. The vendors are serious about selling, so come through, take a proper look and decide for yourself what this opportunity is worth.\r\n\r\nThe property is scheduled for auction (unless sold prior) on Tuesday the 17th November 2026 at the Bucklands Beach Yacht Club.\r\n\r\nContact Simon Davies or Renee Davies for a private viewing should the open home times not suit.",
